  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NEFCO Mykolaiv NRW 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at improving the sustainability of water supply system. The main results of the project is to  reduce water loss and improve infrastructure - replacing obsolete pipelines and valves, etc. to lower water loss and increase system reliability. Furthermore, a result of the project is to reduce energy consumption - install new energy-efficient equipment at booster pumping stations.</narrative>
  </description>
